    "slug": "militants-attack-family-home-in-qandala-puntland",
    "summary": "Armed men belonging to DCSH attacked a family home in Kayaxa, near Sheebaab village in Qandala, on September 20, 2026. The home belonged to a Puntland Darawiish officer. No casualties were reported, but property was damaged.",
    "content": "On September 20, 2026, a group of armed militants belonging to DCSH carried out an attack on a family residence in the Kayaxa area, close to Sheebaab village in the town of Qandala, located in the Bari region of Puntland. The home is reported to belong to an officer serving with the Puntland Darawiish forces.\n\nAccording to Siciid Cali Oorshe, the father of the family, the attackers used gunfire and hand grenades during the assault. At the time of the attack, the house was occupied by three young children, their mother, and their grandmother. Oorshe stated that while no one was killed or injured, the attack caused significant damage to property.\n\nThe incident is part of a pattern of targeted attacks by DCSH, a militant group that has been active in the region. Puntland security forces have been engaged in operations against such groups, particularly in the Bari region, where Qandala is located. The targeting of a military officer's family suggests a deliberate attempt to intimidate and destabilize local communities.\n\nFor the Somali diaspora, this attack highlights the persistent security challenges in parts of Somalia, including Puntland. Many diaspora members have family ties to the region and closely monitor such incidents. The assault on a family home, especially one with children present, underscores the risks faced by civilians and the importance of supporting peace and stability efforts.\n\nThe lack of casualties in this attack does not diminish its severity. Attacks on civilian homes can lead to displacement, psychological trauma, and further insecurity. The diaspora often plays a role in supporting affected families and advocating for stronger protection measures.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/09/20/maleeshiyaad-dcsh-ah-oo-weerar-ku-qaaday-guri-qoys-oo-ku-yaalla-deegaanka-kayaxa/",
